TIMESTAMPING
------------

OpenTimestamps  —  https://opentimestamps.org
    Release packages carry .ots receipts committing their sha256 into the
    Bitcoin blockchain via public calendar servers (alice.btc, bob.btc,
    finney.eternitywall). The receipts are published as release assets so the
    timestamps can be verified without trusting Velotrax.


